## 排错速查

| 现象 | 检查 |
|------|------|
| `Missing required parameter` | 节点/工作流参数面板，`SKYNET_ARGS` 是否为空 |
| DPE `ModuleNotFoundError: rosbags` | `dpe_image` + `docker/dpe-deps` |
| DPE `Can't get attribute 'X.__init__' on __main__` | 节点内禁止 dataclass/自定义 class；改 dict；跑 `pipeline/scripts/check_dpe_nodes.py` |
| Job3 taxonomy 找不到 | OSS 是否已有 `config/oms_label_taxonomy.yaml` |
| Job2/3/4 找不到上游 payload | 上一节点 OSS 路径、`run_id` 是否一致；**`clip_id` 是否带 `sha256:`** |
| Job3 图片 not found（路径重复 `parsed/output/clips/...`） | 更新 `job3_label_node`；可选重跑 `job2_sample` |
| Job3 VL `storage_options` / `InvalidAccessKeyId` | 用 `label_image_mode=auto`（`oss_url`+`role_arn`）或 `base64`；勿只用 `o.account` AK；见 `job3-maxframe-vl.mdc` |
| Job3 `AttributeError: IMAGE_BASE64` | 改为 `ImageContentType.BASE64`；重跑 `bundle_dataworks_node.py` |
| Job3 极慢（prepare 70s+） | 勿在 `manifest_json` 传 base64；`label_image_mode=auto` + `ai_parallel_partitions=16` |
| Job3 `status:ok` 但 values 是错误串 | 查 `_infer_label_status`；OSS/模型错误应标 `error` |
| job2_mc_write 找 `job2_mc_payload.json` | 节点须为**合并版** `_job2_merge_payload_row` |
| dispatch OSS timeout / InvalidAccessKeyId | 内网 endpoint + `oss_vl_*` AK；见 `dataworks-dispatch-oss.mdc` |
| 节点 `ds=bizdate` | 改为 `${bizdate}` 或 `20260608` |
| 写 MC 失败 | Quota、`ds` 分区、表 DDL |
| `trying to delete from a non-transactional table` | `dim_clip` 用 `INSERT OVERWRITE` upsert |

